WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.650
<b>Gintoki and the gang have followed the 
missing Elizabeth into the Renho mothership.</b>

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:41.080
<b>The evil lord Dark Vader prepares 
to invade Earth. Can he be stopped?!</b>

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.040
What are you doing, you three stooges?!

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:45.790
Look out!

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.040
It can't be!

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:53.710
He was promoted for his work on Earth...

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:56.670
<b>You punks got spirit.</b>

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:57.510
<b>Interested in becoming my men?</b>

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:58.510
E-

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:01.390
Elizabeth!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.640
<b>It appears that you Earthlings are 
the ones who will lose their seeds.</b>

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.890
You're the one who faces destruction.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:05.310
<b>I commend you for having the courage to come alone into enemy territory.
 I will grant you an up-close view of the destruction of Earth.</b>

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:10.020
You have no right to be a leader 
when you call your comrades tools.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.150
Don't underestimate the 
planet of the samurai.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.650
<b>I don't need soldiers or citizens.</b>

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.570
<b>As long as I have those, 
I can conquer the galaxy.</b>

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:16.820
<b>The samurai will soon learn</b>

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.030
<b>why the Renho Army soldiers</b>

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.160
<b>are feared as the white devils.</b>

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.830
Renho Army?

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:27.080
Don't you mean the Renho Federation?!

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:33.090
<b>Piggy Banks and Trash Cans</b>

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:38.590
Quiet down.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.330
We managed to sneak all the way in here.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.520
Don't waste that for the sake of a joke.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:45.600
Uh, wait, Fumiko-san!

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:48.640
This is why you're known 
as the white devils?!

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:53.910
These are the new white outfits that were 
developed for the invasion of Earth.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.740
The anti-samurai weapon, Gunsam!

00:02:57.170 --> 00:03:00.870
They've made incredible 
progress while I was gone.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:04.090
Uh, in the end, this is 
just a blatant rip-off!

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:06.120
Those look very familiar!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.080
Dark Vader intends to have the Gunsams

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:10.970
attack Earth once the rain 
has left the planet in chaos.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:14.400
Earth won't last long 
against such an onslaught!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.670
Uh, we won't last long against a 
copyright infringement lawsuit.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:22.420
Both were animated by Sunrise, 
so a lawsuit would go nowhere.

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:24.340
They planned ahead.

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:26.060
That's plain evil!

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:30.820
In any case, we have plenty 
of incentive to destroy those.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.900
How do we do that?

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.150
We'll have to think of something.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.350
Before he...

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:42.400
Before General Eren leads his strike 
force of Gunsams to attack Earth.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:47.410
I never imagined that he would become 
a general in such a short time.

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:52.750
And I never imagined that we would 
become Elizabeth's subordinates.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:56.960
Maybe Eli recognized us?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:04:01.540
He may do his job well, but 
he's always been rather dense.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.830
He couldn't even recognize his own girlfriend

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.220
when I changed to a different color ribbon.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:08.050
Uh, how is anyone supposed to pick you out?!

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.220
This is harder than trying to find Waldo!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.320
I see.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:14.350
So he won't recognize Shinpachi 
since he's a different color.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.340
He'll recognize me!

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.480
He should recognize me when 
I'm sticking out of your head!

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.650
Anyway, now that we're here, 
this is the perfect chance.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:24.510
I'll try to find a way 
to destroy the Gunsams.

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:26.320
You do what you can to 
disable the three stooges

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.300
and other pilots who are 
part of the strike force.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.230
Be careful, Cool Lady Fumi.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:32.790
Okay...

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.540
Gin-san, did you hear all that?

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:38.040
Loyal soldiers of the Renho Army!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.410
Thanks to our Elizabeth Rain,

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:44.050
over half of the Earthlings 
are now trapped behind signs.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:49.160
The clouds surrounding Earth 
are a symbol of our justice.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:55.560
The Earth's military is but 
a shell of its former self.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.390
Verily, I declare them to be trash!

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:02.320
Earthlings treasure their three M's above all.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.070
Their money, their mothers, 
and their manhood.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.670
We start by hitting them in their manhood

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:09.830
and immobilizing them.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.950
Then we take their mothers hostage

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.580
and seize their money!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:16.080
We can render them helpless!

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:19.150
On the battlefield, you have to 
rely on the voices of your allies.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:23.220
Remember to ditch your signs and provide 
your comrades with vocal support.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:26.050
And you're only allowed to 
bring 300 yen worth of snacks.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:29.510
Don't forget your Gelgoog bag for 
when you get mobile suit sickness...

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.230
Why are you people teaching 
them how to defeat Earthlings?!

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.750
Why are you even here?!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.020
You're clearly helping the wrong side!

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.800
You hit me!

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.150
Bright-san never hit me!

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.300
Most people haven't been hit by Bright!

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.520
Sorry.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:51.390
I fell into my old habits after getting all 
fired up about about the upcoming battle.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.360
What the hell were the wars like 
back when you were fighting?!

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:56.790
That last part was more or less 
instructions for a picnic!

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.170
<b>Teacher! Can we take our 
PSPs onto the battlefield?</b>

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.640
Okay, this is a battlefield, right?

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:05.130
So you should be playing battlefield 
games, if you get my drift.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:10.550
<b>What?!</b>

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.620
Why is this turning into a lecture?!

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:08.890
Who's the teacher?!

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.750
Fine, fine.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.100
That concludes today's court-martial.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.420
Everyone go outside for some Uno!

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:16.820
Why would you play Uno outside?!

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.440
Do you really want to play Uno?!

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:20.720
Don't worry, Alzabeth.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:22.730
I'll move three times faster than usual.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.260
That's not gonna help, you stupid Red Comet!

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:26.930
It's the job of a general to play some Uno

00:06:26.930 --> 00:06:31.550
and help put the men in that zone 
between composure and passion.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:33.950
You people are between dumb and dumber!

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:37.470
What is this?!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.270
Why are you playing Uno with the invaders?!

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:40.780
I can see! I can see the enemy's hand!

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:40.780
Why are you bonding with them?!

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.450
They're winning over the enemy.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:45.050
Tsk, how can this be...

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:46.210
They may have fallen, but they 
were stars during the Joi era.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:52.180
<b>What a strange bunch.</b>

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:50.700
Eli-

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.750
General Eren!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.470
<b>You were able to sap away 
the tension before a battle.</b>

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.100
<b>You have the odd ability to draw 
people in while doing stupid things.</b>

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.980
<b>Or maybe they were drawn 
in by your Earth smell.</b>

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:07.110
<b>You were also working as 
spies on Earth, right?</b>

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.990
<b>The same goes for everyone in my squad.</b>

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.530
<b>We were all ordered to infiltrate Earth 
and make contact with Earthlings.</b>

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.410
<b>Uno!</b>

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.000
<b>And now we're trying to 
destroy the people of Earth.</b>

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:21.230
So everyone here loves Earth.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:25.500
Otherwise, they wouldn't know the rules.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.000
<b>Uno</b>

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.250
Katsura-san...

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.760
<b>I also played a lot of Uno.</b>

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:37.020
No!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:38.270
<b>He would challenge me to a 
game whenever we had time.</b>

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.240
C-Can you let me redo that...

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.520
<b>But he sucked... I had to 
let him win a few times.</b>

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:44.520
<b>I guess I was already lying to him back then.</b>

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.440
Do you regret it?

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.840
Then why...?

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:52.330
Everyone here found something 
important to them on Earth.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:54.620
Everyone here has grown to care for Earth.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.530
I-I am the same way.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.020
So why are we invading Earth?

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.540
<b>...I'll pretend I didn't hear that.</b>

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:05.290
<b>The Renho purge all who express dissent.</b>

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:08.170
<b>And keep your mouth shut. You 
won't get another warning.</b>

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:15.180
If the general were to show a sign, 
everyone would revolt together.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.180
Nobody would have to 
worry about a purge then.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.200
Is that what you're saying?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.190
<b>I learned many things on Earth.</b>

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.310
<b>Things that I wouldn't have learned 
on this planet of cold steel.</b>

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:25.560
<b>Defeat</b>

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:29.440
<b>Many things that were warm to the touch.</b>

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:35.110
<b>I learned many things from the person</b>

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.450
<b>whom with I fought back-to-back.</b>

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.830
<b>That's why I have no regrets.</b>

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.710
<b>There is something I must protect.</b>

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:46.710
<b>Even if it means destroying Earth.</b>

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.590
<b>Even if it means fighting against him.</b>

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.590
<b>A true friend will always 
protect a friend's back.</b>

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:57.470
<b>That is what I learned 
from my friend on Earth.</b>

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:10.480
Elizabeth...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.620
<b>Attack Order
In one hour, the entire armada will advance on Earth. All squadrons should immediately prepare for battle.</b>

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.780
W-We've been given the order to attack.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.680
Already?!

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.380
What happened to Mutsu-san's negotiations?!

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:41.670
Mutsu, I see that you screwed up.

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:43.980
I bought you plenty of time.

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.770
You were able to come up with a plan, right?

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:49.240
You bet! The guy before me used a Draw 2,

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:50.800
so I tossed out a Draw 4,

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:54.140
but then he said that going by Earth 
rules, I could only use a Draw 2,

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.530
so I tore my Draw 4 in half.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:57.690
The hell are you doing?!

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:01.220
I'm out here risking my life to buy you time!

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.180
What are we going to do?!

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.360
The Kaientai have been locked up!

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.290
We can't do anything!

00:10:07.070 --> 00:10:08.480
You don't need to worry.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:09.790
We're ready to go.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:11.170
Katsura-san.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.290
Relax...

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.930
Elizabeth is still Elizabeth.

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:17.050
The Elizabeth I believe in.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:23.040
We've been separated due to our 
positions as Earthling and Renho,

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:23.930
<b>How do you write out Renho?</b>

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:26.560
but we still believe in the same things.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:26.480
<b>Don't look.</b>

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.680
In that case, I can't let him down.

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:32.830
Not when my friend says 
that he believes in me.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.740
I'll stop the Renho.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:41.640
Even if it means cutting down Elizabeth.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:43.990
Zura...

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:48.330
<b>What are you doing, Teacher? The general 
is already on his way to the front lines.</b>

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:48.330
Yes, I'm coming.

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:53.760
I'm going to stop Elizabeth's strike force.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.090
Wait, Zura!

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:56.010
You're going to fight Eli?!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.930
Yeah, knock yourself out, Zura.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:01.050
While you're running cover,

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.510
we'll take out the big boss.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:04.970
Gin-chan! Moldie!

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.680
Doesn't matter how big the serpent 
is. Cut off its head and it'll stop.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:11.980
Then we might not have to 
cut off its tail, Kintoki.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:16.280
Well, that's only if we don't 
get choked to death first.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.560
What are you babbling about?

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.990
Your brain was already choked to death.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.160
Don't look back.

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:30.010
I won't.

00:11:34.350 --> 00:11:36.290
You got my back.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:55.020
I guess we don't need to worry 
about the three stooges.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:12:00.780
In that case, we should 
help delay the soldiers.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:04.240
And how is Katsura-san going 
to stop the strike force?

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.160
Is he going to use that thing?

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.160
Can he even pilot it?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.660
Alzabeth!

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.390
Fumiko-san!

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:15.600
What's going on?

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:18.170
Why did the attack start so soon?

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:19.670
Well...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.550
I don't believe it!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:25.110
Just a little longer and I could 
have disabled all of the Gunsams!

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.180
Huh? You were able to do 
something in such a short time?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.180
You helped divert the 
attention of the guards,

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.440
so while I wasn't able to do 
anything to the mothership,

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.980
I managed to sabotage the Gunsams.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:36.940
What did you do?!

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.330
A-Amazing...

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:11.560
No wonder Vader is so taken by these.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.300
Okay! Just you wait, Elizabeth!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.060
Gunsam, ready to launch!

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:23.250
Katsura, heading out!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:27.870
What did I do?

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:29.990
I placed bombs in them.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.620
Ka-Katsura...

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.530
...blew up!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:49.930
<b>What is it?</b>

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.510
<b>W-Well...</b>

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.520
<b>The Gunsam that launched suddenly blew up...</b>

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:54.890
<b>What?!</b>

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.390
<b>Could it be that...</b>

00:13:57.390 --> 00:14:00.400
<b>they have other allies...?</b>

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.690
<b>Spies!</b>

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:05.490
<b>There are Earth spies on this ship!</b>

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:09.950
<b>The attack is off!!</b>

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.620
<b>Capture any suspicious rats 
and make it run blood!!</b>

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.160
<b>Don't let any of them escape!!</b>

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:19.740
In any case, we were able to delay them.

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:22.000
Uh, we lost one of our friends.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.830
But it's strange...

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:27.010
The bomb I placed wasn't that strong, was it?

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:30.040
It was only supposed to blow off a leg...

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:30.800
Hm?

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.130
Hey, look over there!

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:36.890
Wh-What is that?!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.960
Hey, Tatsuma, don't tell me 
that you've lost your edge

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:43.400
after becoming a merchant.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.790
Can't really say.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:48.460
I was always more of a peace 
lover compared to you boys.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:51.060
My mind's sharp as a razor, but I can't be 
so confident about my ability with a blade.

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:52.340
I see.

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:54.750
So your mind and sword are both rusty.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.290
<b>Hey, fools.</b>

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.910
<b>What's going on?</b>

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.580
<b>That's Dark Vader's office.</b>

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.580
<b>What business do you have there?</b>

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.920
<b>We have a message for him.</b>

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.170
<b>What?! Did you find the spies?</b>

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:06.670
No.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:13.050
The samurai...

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.680
...have invaded your planet.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.810
<b>You're the ones from earlier!!</b>

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.940
<b>I knew there was something 
suspicious about you.</b>

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.150
<b>To think that you were samurai...!!</b>

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.810
<b>Why are you out here in space?!</b>

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.930
You people didn't do enough research.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:30.850
The samurai weren't wiped off Earth.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:34.580
Have you forgotten the names of 
the Amanto's most dreaded enemies?

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:37.080
With our swords, we kept...

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:38.330
...our country...

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:39.580
...our friends...

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:43.400
...our souls safe from the aliens.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.960
The Joi patriot, Sakamoto Tatsuma.

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:47.460
Sakata Gintoki.

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:49.920
We'll take you on!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.230
This is a one night ceremony!

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:03.520
Tatsuma, show them that you 
haven't lost your edge!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.530
Yeah, got it!

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:08.320
Time to go wild!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:17.200
<b>Sakamoto Tatsuma</b>

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:15.880
Excuse me, I'm Sakamoto Tatsuma, 
chief logistics officer for the Joi.

00:16:15.880 --> 00:16:17.200
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:25.400
I believe that you're one of the Double 
Dragons who lead this jolly group.

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.170
Are you on the right or left?

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:28.710
<b>I'm the right Dragon.</b>

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.720
Oh, that must be rough.

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:35.910
You have to deal with the random gusts 
in right field at Koshien Stadium.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.930
Well, I'm sure you have 
a story or two to tell.

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:44.520
What are you doing?!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:48.220
Don't mind me. Carry on with your fun.

00:16:48.220 --> 00:16:50.480
I have my own way of going wild.

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:51.490
<b>Prepare yourself!</b>

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:53.740
Your own way of going wild?

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.490
I'm the only one fighting here!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.240
<b>What are you trying to pull?</b>

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:02.010
Well, just between you and me,

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:06.370
I was only pretending to 
want to protect Earth.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.250
Truth is that I came all 
the way here to do business.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.130
<b>Business?</b>

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:16.010
Yes, I consider space to be home.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.140
So I feel no attachment to Earth.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.810
<b>You're going to sell Earth? That's what your 
subordinate said when you first snuck on board.</b>

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:25.120
Please, she's a fledgling who 
knows nothing about business.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.210
She always snaps when a 
deal doesn't go her way.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:32.570
However, now I know what you people want.

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:32.570
<b>What?</b>

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:35.220
You want a weapon that will be more useful

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:37.780
than those white devils 
for the invasion of Earth.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:38.740
Isn't that right?

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:42.540
I have the perfect thing!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:43.680
Yes!

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:47.430
To counter your white devils, 
I offer a white demon.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:49.930
The White Yaksha.

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:55.490
I've colored him completely 
white to satisfy your needs.

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:56.880
What the hell are you talking about?!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:01.140
And I'll even include the weapon 
of self destruction, Zura,

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:04.290
and the adult toy, Sakamoldie.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.390
It's an amazing deal!

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:08.900
<b>Is this some kind of joke?</b>

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:11.400
I would never joke about selling my friends.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.750
Why not have the White Yaksha 
and White Devil fight it out?

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:19.570
That man doesn't give a damn about Earth.

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:20.160
<b>Now to finish him!</b>

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.920
He's a demon who's capable of

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:26.050
crushing an Earth or two for 
the sake of his friends.

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.920
If you don't buy him, 
he'll crush your planet.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:36.170
But if we join forces, we can take over 
Earth or any planet of your choice.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:40.180
<b>Nonsense! After invading our planet, 
you now offer to help us take Earth?</b>

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.600
Sure thing.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:46.300
If we keep fighting, we'll just 
weaken our forces for nothing.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:51.070
If you provide another place 
for the Earthlings to live,

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.190
we'll give you Earth in a split second.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:57.120
Planets are just a place 
for people to stand on.

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:59.410
A planet is just a rock.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.700
Takes people to make it a world.

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:05.190
You can have all the piggy banks you want.

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:07.710
I'm only interested in what's inside.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:11.570
Well, there definitely isn't gold inside.

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:15.210
Just a bunch of old scarred steel.

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:21.880
But I consider that steel the greatest 
treasure there could ever be.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.230
<b>Joi patriots?</b>

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.320
<b>They weren't in the data 
provided by the advance scouts.</b>

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:36.150
<b>Reinforce our troops.</b>

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.490
<b>Grind the Earthlings into space dust.</b>

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:41.280
<b>M-My lord!!</b>

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.160
<b>B-Behind you!!</b>

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:46.830
Th-That's...

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.000
<b>What...?</b>

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.080
<b>...is that?</b>

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:57.550
E-Earth is...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.090
<b>Smiling.</b>

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.100
Huh? Your face is...

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:10.030
And you're talking.

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:11.470
Y-You're right! My voice!

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:13.100
My face is back to normal!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:16.730
This is a rain from the heavens!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:20.110
The gods haven't abandoned us yet!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:22.950
Are you watching this?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.760
The people who lost their 
voices are recovering!

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:29.370
It's wonderful! So wonderful!

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.370
<b>Th-This is!!</b>

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.370
<b>M-My Lord!!</b>

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.130
Wonderful for me!

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:31.400
Wonderful for you!

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.370
Wonderful for everyone!

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:34.380
Th-The clouds...

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.270
The clouds that were covering 
Earth have dissipated...

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:12.410
<b>To my home planet.</b>

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:12.410
<b>To my friend.</b>

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:12.410
<b>From Space,</b>

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:12.410
<b>with love.</b>

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:23.010
<b>It appears that those rats weren't the 
only ones with a trick up their sleeves.</b>

00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:31.220
That's...

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.230
<b>You fooled me.</b>

00:21:33.510 --> 00:21:35.230
I fooled no one.

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:38.980
The words written on that planet aren't

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:41.360
the words of a spy, a general, or a Renho.

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:46.990
They're Elizabeth's first 
and last words of truth!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.490
Elizabeth!

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:00.040
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:42.230
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:34.140
Dark Vader finally reveals his 
true power and attacks the Gunsam.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:37.100
The battles that ensue inspires terror

00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:40.260
that Katsura and Eren have 
never experienced before!

00:23:40.260 --> 00:23:42.230
Next time: Empty planet.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:45.020
<b>Empty Planet</b>

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:45.020
Will you survive?

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:49.400
<b>Speaking of which, will this 
anime be able to survive?</b>

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:55.030
<b>When we first started Gintama, we 
figured there would never be any mecha.</b>
